{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨隨事乃有眾多，且依成文略出要用，若餘不盡在於大本。凡在大眾內欲作羯磨，作羯磨者集唱：僧今和集欲\n作何事？僧中一人應隨答作某羯磨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說已唱白\n羯磨，若在戒場上但唱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受三歸五戒法，白衣初來欲受三歸五戒，教禮佛法僧，胡跪合掌懺\n悔三業，然後受之。戒師應教云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有人來欲受八戒，先教禮三寶，然後教胡跪合掌。戒師應教如是說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "優婆夷受文亦如是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘尼受戒滿十二歲欲畜眾，集僧胡跪合掌應如是乞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛語：「諸比丘！從今欲求出家人有二事應白僧：一出家剃頭，若已剃\n髮來，一事應白僧。僧若集，應言：」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若僧不集，應別房白，\n應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若有袈裟，應著；若無，和上應與，教胡\n跪合掌，先教求和上，應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。戒師應教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "優婆夷三歸五戒、八戒，沙\n彌尼三歸十戒受文，盡與上沙彌出家十戒文同，此中但以稱沙彌尼為異耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若沙彌尼初來，應教次第頭面禮僧足已，次第應求和上尼。戒師教\n言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能。即應將至戒場上，著見處離聞處。爾時應問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。若僧一心和合\n者，應喚沙彌尼來，教頭面一一禮僧足已，次應教令從僧乞二歲學戒，作如是說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三乞。即時戒師應僧中唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即時為式叉摩尼說六法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "式叉摩尼初來入尼僧中，頭面一一禮僧足。禮僧足已，尼戒師應教\n受衣鉢，應問：「此五衣鉢是汝有不？」答言：「是。」應教効我語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。次教令求\n和上尼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。戒師應問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和上尼答言：「能。」應教著見\n處離聞處。尼戒師應僧中作如是唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一比丘尼言：「我能。」佛\n言如是，比丘尼若成就五法，應差作教師。何等五？不隨愛教、瞋教、怖教、癡教、知教不教應知。教師即時唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已被羯磨者應往式\n\n叉摩尼所教正衣服，右膝著地合掌而問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尼教師問竟應白僧：「是式叉摩尼某甲，我已問竟。」尼羯磨師應言：「清淨者將來。」次教乞屬和上，尼羯磨應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。尼戒師應僧中作如是唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師僧中問遮法，與上教師問遮法中同，上以空靜處、此以眾中以\n為異耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是中尼戒師即時應僧中唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘尼眾應在尼寺中作如是羯磨竟，即日將至大僧中和合與受具足戒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將至大僧中，頭面一一禮僧足，禮僧足已\n應教從和上尼乞受具足戒，應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。故次教從僧乞受具足戒，應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三乞。一比丘應僧中唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應語彼言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應教言：「若人問汝幾歲？應答言無歲。\n何時節？隨時應答若春若夏若冬，某月某日某時，有閏無閏，皆應隨實答。是事汝盡壽應為憶念持。」即應為說三依止法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "酥、油、蜜、石蜜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "驢脂、猪脂、熊脂、鱣脂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舍利薑、赤附子、波提鞮沙、昌蒱根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "訶梨\n勒、阿摩勒、鞞醯勒、胡椒、畢鉢羅也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紫鹽、白鹽、黑鹽、赤鹽、樓鹽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花湯、葉湯、根湯、\n莖湯、果湯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "興渠、薩闍羅、諦夜、諦夜婆提、諦夜波那"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能。次應說八墮法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛語諸比丘：「受具足法，有三事現前得受具足。何等三？一有僧、二有\n人欲受具足、三有羯磨，是為三。」欲受具足人初來，應教次第頭面禮僧足，禮僧足已教受衣，應問：「此衣是汝有不？」答言：「是。」\n應教汝効我語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次問：「此衣是汝有不？」答言：「是。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次問：「此衣是汝有不？」答言：「是。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次問：「此鉢多羅是汝有不？」答言：「是。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。受衣鉢已應求和上，應言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。戒師應問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和上答言：「我某甲能。」即時捨聞處著見處。戒師應唱眾僧和集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若僧中有比丘言：「我能。」若有五法不應立作教師：愛教、瞋教、怖教、癡教、教不教不知。五法\n成就應立作教師：不愛教、不瞋教、不怖教、不癡教、教不教知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即時教師往弟子所，教偏袒著衣胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師語：「若清淨者將來。」教禮僧足，禮僧足已從僧乞受具足戒耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。即時一比丘唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師問遮法文，與上教師問遮法文同。上以空靜，此以眾中以為異耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師應唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若人問：「汝幾歲？應言未有\n歲。何時？若冬若春若夏有閏無閏，是時節汝盡壽應憶念。」即時應說四依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "酥、油、蜜、石蜜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熊脂、\n驢脂、猪脂、鱣脂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舍利、薑、赤附子、波提鞮沙、昌蒲根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呵梨勒、鞞\n醯勒、阿摩勒、胡椒、跋鉢羅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黑鹽、白鹽、紫鹽、赤鹽、魯出鹽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "根湯、莖湯、\n葉湯、花湯、果湯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "興渠、薩闍羅、諦掖、諦掖婆提、諦掖婆那"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先結空地界，然後結界場。先一比丘唱四方小界相作畔齊已，作白二羯磨，在\n眾中作，如是白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先令一比丘唱四方大界相作畔齊已，作白二羯磨，在眾中作，如是白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解小界亦依此文，正言小界為異耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以無別解衣界文者，欲\n更廣促界者亦應解衣界後解大界；若直解大界，衣界亦并自去，故不煩文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執事人有十四種，五法成：不隨愛、不隨瞋、不隨怖、不隨癡、\n知得不。一比丘僧中唱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘十三種人亦應羯磨差。尼家十二種，文亦同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛言：「五眾應安居。何等五人者？一比丘、二比丘尼、三式叉摩尼、四沙彌、五\n沙彌尼。」云何應受安居？佛言，若上座欲安居，應從坐起，偏袒著衣胡跪合掌，應如是言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若下座受安居，如上座法，唯除捉兩\n足為異耳。後三月受持亦爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乞三十九夜出界文，若僧眾受遣不須乞，若私營三寶事\n須乞。乞法者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受法上下儀法如上，故不煩文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0949a03"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0520b29"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0950a23"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0951a11"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0952a10"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0952b15"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0952c20"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0954a23"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0523a27"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Q22_p0523c29"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0955b05"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0957a23"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "Q22_p0525a19"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0957b02"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K23n0920_p0959a20"}
{"id": null, "n": "0496001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0496001", "type": "mod", "text": "一卷【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0496002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0496002", "type": "mod", "text": "宋【大】，劉宋【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0496003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0496003", "type": "mod", "text": "沙門【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0496004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0496004", "type": "mod", "text": "於楊都中興寺【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
